					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-691478#post-1845896</guid>
				<title>Author Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-691478/leafers#post-1845896</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 05 Sep 2013 02:08:39 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>HammerMaiden</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1552358</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Leafers is a tale set in the S&amp;C Plastics canon about what happens when a weathered old researcher tries to get away from the hustle and bustle of the Foundation at large. Dr. Marshall Grant decided it was time to get away for a while, clear his head, move out to a low-sec site for a year or two to relieve some stress. Unfortunately, stress has a way of following you wherever you go, doesn't it?</p> <p>This is one of my first serious attempts at writing comedy, and I'm very pleased with the results. Thanks Djoric and Ihpkmn for your support and for helping make this canon a thing. I love it.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
